      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is tree removal cost calculated?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Cost starts from a base price tied to size (height + DBH), plus modifiers for species hardness, access constraints, crane requirement, permit fees, a stump grinding add-on and emergency timing. The base accounts for roughly 60–70% of the typical quote; the modifiers explain the rest of the variance." }
