      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How can I lower my tree removal cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Schedule in winter, when leaves-off access can speed crews up by 10–20%; accept chip-drop on-site instead of full haul-off, saving $50–$150 in disposal; and bundle stump grinding with the removal for the package rate. Size and access generally can't be changed, so be wary of quotes that promise unrealistically low numbers." }
